description: Security hygiene across the stack.
alwaysApply: true

# Input & Output
- Validate/authorize requests (Form Requests/Policies).
- Escape output by default in Blade.
- Use CSRF tokens for forms and Axios requests.

# Common Risks
- Prevent SQL injection (bindings), XSS (escaping), CSRF (tokens), SSRF (validate URLs), file upload risks (mime/size/scan).
- Never expose secrets to the client; use env configuration via server only.

# Dependencies
- Ask before adding new libraries. Explain risks, maintenance, and bundle impact.
